      "local_prompts": "Wide shot, Pixar 3D animation style. Inside the golden-lit attic, the 8-year-old girl Mira is firmly kneeling in a locked, fixed position beside the open chest. Her lower body and hips remain completely static with zero shifting or drifting. Only her arms move naturally to lift a faded envelope. In the background, continuous sunbeams filter through the window, with distinct, highly dynamic dust particles swirling and floating actively in the light. | Wide shot, identical static camera perspective and attic background. The girl on the left remains perfectly quiet, her expression still, with her lips completely sealed and motionless. On the right, the small round robot Bolt tilts its head smoothly toward the photo. Its large blue LED eyes pulse actively with a shifting light frequency. The warm volumetric window light subtly flickers, with tiny atmospheric dust particles drifting around them. | Medium close-up shot, subtle cinematic push-in, Pixar 3D animation style. Mira holds the black-and-white photograph closer to her face. Her upper body is firmly anchored and stable, preventing any unnatural drifting or shoulder swaying. Her head tilts slightly to one side with fluid, controlled motion; her hazel eyes soften with a quiet, tearful expression of recognition. Shallow depth of field keeps the background attic elements blurred, while tiny, sharp dust specks float in the foreground warm light, creating a focused, intimate atmosphere. | Two-shot, mid-shot, static camera, Pixar 3D animation style. In the nostalgic attic, Mira looks down with a tender, warm smile, her sitting posture firmly locked onto the wooden floorboards with zero sliding or shifting. On the right, the small white robot Bolt tilts its entire upper dome upward to gaze at her. Bolt’s blue LED eyes pulse in a gentle, rhythmic breath pattern. The air texture is calm, with a soft, steady glow of golden light and atmospheric particles moving subtly, bringing the scene to a serene, cinematic conclusion.",
